{"3665040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Monster Quest", "steam_appid": 3665040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you play as Ella.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is a monster farmer. You defeat cute monsters and collect their essence to unlock more abilities and weapons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has rog, boomer shooter and extraction game mode elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hop in a level, defeat cute monsters, collect monster essence, collect collectible items spread across the map, escape from level, return to base and upgrade weapons, skills, and utilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the final build there will be a monsterpedia, the more monsters you defeat, the more monster data you will uncover.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you play as Ella.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is a monster farmer. You defeat cute monsters and collect their essence to unlock more abilities and weapons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has rog, boomer shooter and extraction game mode elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hop in a level, defeat cute monsters, collect monster essence, collect collectible items spread across the map, escape from level, return to base and upgrade weapons, skills, and utilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the final build there will be a monsterpedia, the more monsters you defeat, the more monster data you will uncover.</p>", "short_description": "Defeat cute monsters and become the greatest monster farmer.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea